<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post1311007424442806797..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: &quot;Blue Privilege&quot; and the Criminal Enterprise Called The Idaho State Police (UPDATE December 13)</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1311007424442806797/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/blue-privilege-and-criminal-enterprise.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>8</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2223656698308867396</id><published>2016-07-04T21:18:13.953-06:00</published><updated>2016-07-04T21:18:13.953-06:00</updated><title type='text'>True story.&#xa;&#xa;Kevin Haight is the current LT in cha...</title><content type='html'>True story.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Kevin Haight is the current LT in charge of statewide communications for ISP. His brother Krent Haight is incarcerated for repeated crimes of perversion against minors.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1311007424442806797/comments/default/2223656698308867396'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1311007424442806797/comments/default/2223656698308867396'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/blue-privilege-and-criminal-enterprise.html?showComment=1467688693953#c2223656698308867396' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/blue-privilege-and-criminal-enterprise.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1311007424442806797' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1311007424442806797' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1508587283"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 4, 2016 at 9:18 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7358463157931775944</id><published>2015-12-13T04:29:42.709-07:00</published><updated>2015-12-13T04:29:42.709-07:00</updated><title type='text'>See the update above. &#xa;&#xa;As former Idaho AG David L...</title><content type='html'>See the update above. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;As former Idaho AG David Leroy points out, the dismissal of Roseen&amp;#39;s lawsuit (which happened a few weeks after this essay was published) didn&amp;#39;t resolve the questions raised by it, or by the numerous others (including two who filed separate lawsuits) who have reported the trooper&amp;#39;s habitual abusive behavior.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1311007424442806797/comments/default/7358463157931775944'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1311007424442806797/comments/default/7358463157931775944'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/blue-privilege-and-criminal-enterprise.html?showComment=1450006182709#c7358463157931775944' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/blue-privilege-and-criminal-enterprise.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1311007424442806797' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1311007424442806797' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 13, 2015 at 4:29 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4787061108880142443</id><published>2015-12-13T00:15:13.886-07:00</published><updated>2015-12-13T00:15:13.886-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I imagine a follow up article will be done soon sh...</title><content type='html'>I imagine a follow up article will be done soon showing all of the lawsuits against Klitch have been dismissed and the Troopers suing ISP (including Rice) are having their cases thrown out because they, themselves, withheld exculpatory evidence in the Sloan crash? Or does that not fit the narrative of this website?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1311007424442806797/comments/default/4787061108880142443'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1311007424442806797/comments/default/4787061108880142443'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/blue-privilege-and-criminal-enterprise.html?showComment=1449990913886#c4787061108880142443' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/blue-privilege-and-criminal-enterprise.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1311007424442806797' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1311007424442806797' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1476928840"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 13, 2015 at 12:15 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7487720053127606636</id><published>2015-08-29T08:18:24.705-06:00</published><updated>2015-08-29T08:18:24.705-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Trooper Spike is another ISP scum bag, all ISP law...</title><content type='html'>Trooper Spike is another ISP scum bag, all ISP law enforcement should be considered armed and dangerous and liars until proven otherwise. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1311007424442806797/comments/default/7487720053127606636'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1311007424442806797/comments/default/7487720053127606636'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/blue-privilege-and-criminal-enterprise.html?showComment=1440857904705#c7487720053127606636' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/blue-privilege-and-criminal-enterprise.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1311007424442806797' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1311007424442806797' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1075802079"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 29, 2015 at 8:18 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8725560692220989124</id><published>2015-06-14T22:40:23.783-06:00</published><updated>2015-06-14T22:40:23.783-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I wouldn&amp;#39;t count on any career ends for any of...</title><content type='html'>I wouldn&amp;#39;t count on any career ends for any of the defendants in these lawsuits. They seem to have the full support of their superiors at the highest levels; even if the defendants lose these cases, the higher-ups are more likely to promote them, not fire them.&lt;br /&gt; The problems Mr. Grigg has reviewed here and elsewhere seem to be systemic within IDAHO ISP, and the result of the brass supporting the lack of integrity and professionalism within it&amp;#39;s agency.&lt;br /&gt; Idaho&amp;#39;s governor could likely intervene and influence behavior at ISP, since he is the chief executive of IDAHO.&lt;br /&gt; But I wouldn&amp;#39;t hold my breath on that happening, either.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1311007424442806797/comments/default/8725560692220989124'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1311007424442806797/comments/default/8725560692220989124'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/blue-privilege-and-criminal-enterprise.html?showComment=1434343223783#c8725560692220989124' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/blue-privilege-and-criminal-enterprise.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1311007424442806797' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1311007424442806797' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1805362908"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 14, 2015 at 10:40 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7734995645738633422</id><published>2015-06-09T01:17:47.187-06:00</published><updated>2015-06-09T01:17:47.187-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I predict a fairly soon bad career end for both Kl...</title><content type='html'>I predict a fairly soon bad career end for both Klitch and Richardson.  Idaho is too nice for either one of them.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1311007424442806797/comments/default/7734995645738633422'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1311007424442806797/comments/default/7734995645738633422'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/blue-privilege-and-criminal-enterprise.html?showComment=1433834267187#c7734995645738633422' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/blue-privilege-and-criminal-enterprise.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1311007424442806797' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1311007424442806797' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1171568229"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 9, 2015 at 1:17 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6201295531460835673</id><published>2015-06-08T21:39:20.037-06:00</published><updated>2015-06-08T21:39:20.037-06:00</updated><title type='text'>My wife and I had just tonight, watch the movie ab...</title><content type='html'>My wife and I had just tonight, watch the movie about the useful citizen for government parasites and their personal advancements within the system. The move was about a boxer who was convicted of murders that he never did. But he was a throw away person because in the 50&amp;#39;s being black, a black man&amp;#39;s life had no meaning and was regarded as sub-human to the higher form of life, government employees. Today any citizen no matter who they are, are considered throw away life forms to government employees in their personal advancement. If a citizen&amp;#39;s well being is destroyed along with their family is useful in the personal advancement of a single government employee&amp;#39;s personal gain in their government employment. That citizen has huge problems because they all circle the wagons because its, One for All and All for One. The citizen who pays their wages and so on has become their enemy because the citizen has been pretty much tapped out and has little to give. And is now demanding a stop to the looting of their personal property. To keep the scams, to keep the useless eaters in their useless jobs of government employment, that are nothing more of a service to society than a fly on a cow pie to make the world a better place. The system has turned on such good citizens. The proof of this is, in Will endless amount of stories that have never been challenged or proved incorrect. I rest my case. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1311007424442806797/comments/default/6201295531460835673'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1311007424442806797/comments/default/6201295531460835673'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/blue-privilege-and-criminal-enterprise.html?showComment=1433821160037#c6201295531460835673' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/blue-privilege-and-criminal-enterprise.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1311007424442806797' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1311007424442806797' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1232862362"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 8, 2015 at 9:39 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4179162682808648631</id><published>2015-06-08T07:57:18.540-06:00</published><updated>2015-06-08T07:57:18.540-06:00</updated><title type='text'>the corruption on display is part of the corruptio...</title><content type='html'>the corruption on display is part of the corruption this entire nation has undergone.  seems everywhere one looks, those on the payrolls of various &amp;#39;public&amp;#39; entities - federal, state, county and city - are corrupt.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;when a system is as corrupt as ours has become, there is no &amp;#39;working within the system&amp;#39; to fix the problem.  the only way to &amp;#39;fix&amp;#39; the system is to wipe the slate clean by purging ALL involved. an additional requirement would be to get back to where laws actually stop actions leading to harming others, or their property, instead of the criminalization of everything, as is the case today. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;it is my belief that, in the end, the only remedy is to divide this nation into at least two parts - one for those who love being told what to do all the time with everything criminalized, the other with the only crimes being those that hurt people, or their property - and then letting people have a true choice as to what type of govt they will live under.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1311007424442806797/comments/default/4179162682808648631'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1311007424442806797/comments/default/4179162682808648631'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/blue-privilege-and-criminal-enterprise.html?showComment=1433771838540#c4179162682808648631' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/blue-privilege-and-criminal-enterprise.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1311007424442806797' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1311007424442806797' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1211788951"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 8, 2015 at 7:57 AM"/></entry></feed>